{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1sF9pMNJXGh1n2LiufC", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with one confirmed bug and low confidence (0.5). The Decimal places setting is still at 6, because the slider wouldn't go back to 2.\n\n- **Confirmed bug:** Temperature sums shows wrong values.\n  - `25 celsius + 5 celsius` shows 303.15 °C instead of 30 °C.\n  - `20 celsius - 5 celsius` shows -258.15 °C instead of 15 °C.\n  - `10 celsius + 18 fahrenheit` shows 527.67 °F.\n- **Rejected report:** With 4 decimals, Expenses showed `1,200` with no decimals while the other lines were padded (340.5000 and so on). The developer couldn't reproduce it. Integers also show unpadded in Remainders and Percentages, so it looks like normal display.\n- **Looked correct:** Temperatures conversions, Date gaps, Time differences, Remainders, Percentages, and the 4-decimal setting on the Temperatures and Expenses files.\n- **Not opened:** Number bases and Monthly budget.\n- **Unclear:** Time differences shows a minus sign on every part (`-3 h -30 min`). I couldn't tell whether that is intended, so I didn't report it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 496, "cache_read_input_tokens": 31883, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 496}, "output_tokens": 414, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "a35a9870-0618-4b2d-ae7c-cebd2d750ce0", "uuid": "daeb72f4-0717-45e8-9d5b-6df02ebf094d", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:23:17.185Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1sF9Zxhv2ULz3iXeP8F"}
